flowchart LR
    user[Pet owner] --> ui[Streamlit app]
    ui -->|ask or suggest tasks| handler[AI request handler]
    handler -->|search query| retriever[Local retriever]
    retriever -->|read attributed chunks| kb[(Local pet-care knowledge files)]
    kb -->|matching chunks and source IDs| retriever
    retriever -->|grounding context| handler
    handler -->|bounded structured request| gemini[Gemini API]
    gemini -->|answer or proposal with cited IDs| handler
    handler -->|validated answer and sources| ui
    handler -->|candidate tasks for validation| scheduler[Deterministic Scheduler]
    scheduler -->|budget decision and action trace| handler
    ui -->|user adds or edits tasks; generate plan| scheduler
    scheduler -->|plan, conflicts, free slots| ui
    ui -->|explicit save or load| storage[(Local JSON persistence)]
    storage -->|owner, pets, tasks, settings| ui

    subgraph AI_workflow[AI workflow: advisory only]
        handler
        retriever
        kb
        gemini
    end

    subgraph Scheduling_workflow[Scheduling workflow: deterministic]
        scheduler
        storage
    end
